_ZThn1320_N5iplug9IPlugVST310SetLatencyEi
_ZN5iplug9IPlugVST317getLatencySamplesEv
_ZThn1832_N5iplug9IPlugVST317getLatencySamplesEv
_ZThn2088_N5iplug9IPlugVST317getLatencySamplesEv
